{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-on-later-figures","title":"Influence On Later Figures","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-later-figures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"admired-by-leaders","title":"影响近代人物","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-later-figures/admired-by-leaders","wordCount":1925,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-cultivation-tradition","title":"修身传统的传承","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-later-figures/the-cultivation-tradition","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现曾国藩对近代人物与修身传统的影响。曾国藩作为&quot;修身楷模&quot;，深刻地影响了近代中国众多重要人物——毛泽东曾言&quot;愚于近人，独服曾文正&quot;，蒋介石也将其视为修身、治军的楷模；他的影响跨越了不同的政治立场。同时，曾国藩作为中国传统修身文化的集大成者与杰出践行者，使这一宝贵的文化传统得以活态传承，成为后世励志的源泉。本章揭示曾国藩深远的影响。</p>\n"}